<title>USA: U.S. meat output 2.6 pct above week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 2.6 pct above week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Feb 8, rose 2.6 pct at 817.9 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>08-Feb-97	482.1     6.8	 324.1     4.9	817.9</p>
<p>01-Feb-97	460.4     6.5	 326.3     4.3	797.5</p>
<p>Change:	    4.7%    4.6%	 -0.7%   14.0%	2.6%</p>
<p>10-Feb-96	457.4     6.9	 329.8     5.2	799.3</p>
<p>Change:	    5.4%   -1.4%	 -1.7%   -5.8%	 2.3%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     2685.8    36.8	1771.6    23.8     4518.0</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     2811.1    39.1	1982.8    29.9     4862.9</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.5%   -5.9%	-10.7%  -20.4%     -7.1%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>08-Feb-97     700,000	   33,000     1,711,000	75,000</p>
<p>01-Feb-97     669,000	   32,000     1,731,000	66,000</p>
<p>Change:	   4.6%	     3.1%	   -1.2%	 13.6%</p>
<p>10-Feb-96     651,000	   33,000     1,779,000	81,000</p>
<p>Change:	   7.5%	     0.0%	   -3.8%	 -7.4%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   3,901,000	  178,000     9,375,000     367,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  3,964,000	  186,000    10,635,000     464,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.6%	    -4.2%	  -11.8%	-20.8%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    Est    1164	  338	   258	  132</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    Est    1166	  333	   257	  132</p>
<p>10-Feb-96    Actual 1182	  343	   253	  128</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>08-Feb-97    Est     692	  209	   190	   66</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    Est     692	  206	   189	   66</p>
<p>10-Feb-96    Actual  710	  210	   186	   64</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>25-Jan-97    44.1%	  33.6%	20.6%	  1.7%</p>
<p>27-Jan-96    48.9%	  30.3%	19.1%	  1.8%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>25-Jan-97	 96.1%		    3.2%	   0.7%</p>
